    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.direction.night-eater.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.asset.sprite.night-eater",
        "actorId": "night-eater",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "提灯に火が入るころ、夜を食べるものが迎えに来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "連れ立って通りを歩くと、彼の足取りが、利き酒の名人のそれになる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今年の提灯は、良い年です。芯がまっすぐで、後味が甘い」……明かりの、ソムリエだ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "食べ歩きは、行儀よく進んだ。切れかけの電球を、一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "消し忘れの倉庫の灯りも、一口。屋台のおじさんが「うちの余り火もどうだい」と差し出す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街は、彼の食事に、もうすっかり慣れている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "通りの果てで、彼はふと足を止めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさん。少し、暗いところを歩きましょう」耳が一瞬、警戒するように立った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの裏の、灯りのない路地だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この人の誘い文句は、いつも一見、不穏で、いつも、外れない。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暗い路地の真ん中で、彼は言った。「見えますか」見上げると——星だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "提灯の光が届かない場所にだけ、星が満ちている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「暗がりは、星の器なので。ぜんぶは、食べないんです」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日の話を、少しだけした。決勝と、同じ時刻の滅亡ショーの話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の声が硬くなったのが、暗がりでも分かったらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさん。あなたの周りの暗いの、少しだけ、いただきますね」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ふ、と。肩の重さが、一口ぶん、軽くなった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……緊張って、食べられるんですか」「暗ければ、だいたい食べられます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あなたのは、少し塩気がありました。がんばりの味です」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、彼は通りでいちばん見事な提灯の前を、素通りした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「食べないんですか」「今夜いちばんの一灯は、残すんです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「明日、勝って帰ってきたあなたと——一緒に見るぶんなので」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "食いしん坊の、食べ残し。それが、この人の精いっぱいの願掛けだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「じゃあ、明日の夜まで、誰にも食べさせないでくださいね」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ええ。見張っておきます。……主に、私から」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.night-eater.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
